      "created_at": "2014-07-05T19:53:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>First, apologies - I accidentally hit the Split Thread button instead of the Edit button, which has no undo and there's no way to move things back.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/rage.png?v=9\" title=\":rage:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rage:\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Shock Rounds go off once then destroy themselves. See <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/expatriette-shock-rounds-and-submachine-gun\">this thread</a> (and hopefully the system won’t break the link by adding spaces like it did last time).<br><br>Basically you get the first instance of damage from the gun (whatever that is), Shock Rounds do a point to all non-heroes, Shock Rounds destroy themselves, then the rest of the gun’s instances of damage happen (one at a time).</p>",
