      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-07-05T23:02:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Haka of Battle says \"Increase <strong>the next damage dealt</strong> by Haka by 1 for each card discarded this way.\"</p>\n<p>Hollow Points says \"Increase <strong>the damage of that card's power </strong>by 2.\"</p>\n<p>Very different wording.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\">  Hollow Points affects all instances of damage from the Assault Rifle's power.</p>",
