      "created_at": "2014-07-08T00:27:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>And, to clarify again on shock rounds, it isn’t the DAMAGE that triggers the ammo; it is the use of the power itself. So, it can only go off once since you can only use each power once (except for pride-prejudice-pride, but that’s not really relevant.)</p>",
